# Repo Rules

- Use `@midika/utils` for neverthrow helpers and i18n factories.
- Keep UI strings in `apps/web/src/lib/translations.ts`.
- Use `@midika/auth` for authentication; do not wire providers directly in UI.
- Use `@midika/app-sdk` for extension manifests and registries.
- Prefer Server Components; mark Client Components only when needed.
- Apply KISS/DRY/YAGNI when adding code or docs.
